			"notes": "Development preview for **Minecraft 1.20.1 / Forge** and **1.21.1 / NeoForge**.\n\n**Requires Hot Bath 4.2.0 or newer.** Install [the matching Hot Bath preview](https://github.com/CrabMods/hotBath/releases/tag/v4.2.0-preview.20261021). The matched-packages ZIP includes both mods in separate Minecraft-version folders.\n\nChoose the JAR for your Minecraft version. Replace old copies and keep one JAR per mod; use the same pair on the server and clients.\n\nChanges since the October 20 preview:\n\n- Ordinary and special bathtubs and all three pool shapes now inherit Hot Bath datapack temperature, appearance, particles, cleansing, effects and delays; placed baths update after reload without refilling.\n- Shared liquid and optional-mod behavior replaces duplicate integration paths while ShowerCore retains surfaces, geometry and contact checks.\n- Fixed liquid-switch timing, overlapping shower/liquid behavior, legacy saved-fluid identity, duplicate pool lava damage and Forge pool fluid access; fluid-only updates avoid repeated structure checks.\n\nValidation of the matched pair: **412 JVM tests**, **346 core container GameTest methods** across both loaders, plus standalone liquid, seasonal and Forge Alex's Caves checks. Actual clients covered **18 base and 19 optional-mod scenarios per loader**, including Cold Sweat, Tough As Nails, Legendary Survival Overhaul and Farmer's Delight.\n\n[English final verification report](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CrabMods/ShowerCore/1063829e4153e83a97023aad28c012ae182961ff/validation/issue-56/bath-api-4.2.0-final-report-en.mp4) — actual game frames held for comparison.\n\nStill awaiting reproduction details: [#30](https://github.com/CrabMods/ShowerCore/issues/30) and [#31](https://github.com/CrabMods/ShowerCore/issues/31).\n\nDedicated multiplayer and shader-pack compatibility are outside this validation. SHA-256 checksums are attached.\n\nSource snapshots: [NeoForge 1.21.1](https://github.com/CrabMods/ShowerCore/commit/bb431111ddf90429714701d9261979f06d698146), [Forge 1.20.1](https://github.com/CrabMods/ShowerCore/commit/2f17206e9cb2615670577c3d72b3c5c674e2d9bc)."
		},
