			"notes": "> [!WARNING]\n> **Testing build / 测试版本**\n>\n> This Shower Core prerelease is intended only for testing and compatibility validation. It may contain incomplete or insufficiently tested behavior.\n>\n> 本 Shower Core 预发布仅供测试和兼容性验证。**普通玩家请等待 CurseForge 正式发布。**\n\n## Required test setup / 测试组合\n\n- Install the official **Hot Bath 4.1.0** release: https://github.com/crabsatellite/hotBath/releases/tag/v4.1.0\n- Install the matching Shower Core 1.2.0 dev jar below for your Minecraft version.\n- 请使用正式版 **Hot Bath 4.1.0**，不要再使用旧的 Hot Bath dev 测试包。\n\n## Downloads\n\n- `showercore-1.21.1-1.2.0.jar` — Minecraft 1.21.1 / NeoForge, built from `d8c6e76`\n- `showercore-1.20.1-1.2.0.jar` — Minecraft 1.20.1 / Forge, built from `19464d2`\n\n## Test focus\n\n- Fabulous graphics bathtub-water rendering tracked in #3.\n- Clawfoot bathtub faucet switch and water-flow geometry tracked in #4 and #11.\n- Emissive custom-fluid lighting after relogging or changing dimensions tracked in #7.\n- Rubber duck placement in clawfoot bathtubs tracked in #9 and #12.\n\nAutomated `build` and unit tests passed on both branches. GameTestServer passed all 8 required tests on both Minecraft versions. Manual in-game testing is still requested before the CurseForge release."
